---
// Generated from the top.strony design (tools/dc2astro.py). 
const { v } = Astro.props;
---
<main id="main">
  <!-- ============ 2. HERO ============ -->
  <section class="hero" aria-labelledby="hero-h1">
    <div class="wrap">
      <p class="eyebrow h-in" style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; color: var(--muted)"><span style="width: 6px; height: 6px; border-radius: 50%; background: #60AD26"></span>Agencja marketingowa z Piaseczna</p>
      <h1 id="hero-h1" class="h h-in">Strony, SEO i reklamy, które <span style="color: #60AD26">przyprowadzają klientów</span></h1>
      <p class="lead h-in">Projektujemy strony i sklepy, budujemy markę, pozycjonujemy w Google i w odpowiedziach AI, prowadzimy kampanie Google Ads, Meta Ads i social media. Jeden zespół od logo do pierwszego telefonu od klienta.</p>
      <div class="hero-ctas h-in">
        <a data-magnetic href="/kontakt/" class="btn btn-g">Darmowa wycena w 24 h</a>
        <a data-magnetic href="#realizacje" class="btn btn-o">Zobacz efekty</a>
      </div>
      <div class="trust h-in">
        <span><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="#F5B400" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 2l3 6.9 7.5.7-5.7 5 1.7 7.4L12 18.3 5.5 22l1.7-7.4-5.7-5 7.5-.7z"></path></svg><strong>5,0</strong> w Google · 20 opinii</span>
        <span><strong>35</strong> projektów stron i sklepów</span>
        <span><strong>8 lat</strong> w IT i marketingu</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-strip h-in">
      <p class="strip-label">Zaufali nam</p>
      <div class="marquee">
        {(v.logosLoop ?? []).map((l) => (<Fragment>
          <span class="mlogo" role="img" aria-label={l?.name} style={l?.mask}></span>
        </Fragment>))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ============ 3. PROBLEM → ROZWIĄZANIE ============ -->
  <section id="problem" class="sec alt deco-rings" aria-labelledby="problem-h">
    <div class="wrap">
      <p class="eyebrow scr">Rozpoznajesz to?</p>
      <h2 id="problem-h" class="sr-only">Problemy, które rozwiązujemy</h2>
      <p class="manifesto" data-manifesto>
        {(v.manifesto ?? []).map((w) => (<Fragment><span class={`sw ${w?.cls ?? ''}`}>{w?.t} </span></Fragment>))}
      </p>
      <div class="pains stg">
        {(v.pains ?? []).map((pn) => (<Fragment>
          <article class="card hov pain">
            <div class="pain-q"><span class="pain-x" aria-hidden="true">✕</span>{pn?.q}</div>
            <p class="pain-a"><strong>Rozwiązanie:</strong> {pn?.a}</p>
          </article>
        </Fragment>))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ============ 4. USŁUGI ============ -->
  <section id="uslugi" class="sec deco-bars deco-l" aria-labelledby="uslugi-h">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="head rv">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow scr">Usługi</p>
          <h2 id="uslugi-h" class="h h2 split"><span class="wm"><span class="wi">Sześć</span></span> <span class="wm"><span class="wi">usług,</span></span> <span class="wm"><span class="wi">jeden</span></span> <span class="wm"><span class="wi">zespół</span></span> <span class="wm"><span class="wi">i</span></span> <span class="wm"><span class="wi">jeden</span></span> <span class="wm"><span class="wi">opiekun</span></span></h2>
          <p class="lead">Możesz zamówić jedną usługę albo cały marketing. Najlepsze wyniki dają, kiedy strona, SEO, reklamy i social media grają do jednej bramki.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="acc-arrows" style="display: flex; gap: 10px">
          <button type="button" aria-label="Poprzednia usługa" data-act="srv-prev" class="arrow-btn"><svg aria-hidden="true" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M19 12H5M11 5l-7 7 7 7"></path></svg></button>
          <button type="button" aria-label="Następna usługa" data-act="srv-next" class="arrow-btn"><svg aria-hidden="true" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14M13 5l7 7-7 7"></path></svg></button>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="acc rv d1">
        {(v.services ?? []).map((sv) => (<Fragment>
          <div class={`acc-item ${sv?.cls ?? ''}`} data-srv={sv?.i} style={`background: ${sv?.bg ?? ''}`}>
            <div aria-hidden="true" class="acc-grid"></div>
            <svg aria-hidden="true" class="acc-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke-width="0.3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d={sv?.icon}></path></svg>
            <div data-if="srv-a" data-i={sv.i} hidden={!sv?.active}>
              <div class="acc-body">
                <div style="font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .12em; color: #C8F29E">{sv?.n} / 06</div>
                <h3 class="h" style="margin: 14px 0 0; font-size: clamp(30px, 3.4vw, 50px); line-height: 1.04; font-weight: 700; color: #FFFFFF">{sv?.title}</h3>
                <p style="margin: 16px 0 0; max-width: 540px; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.6; color: rgba(255,255,255,.88)">{sv?.text}</p>
                <ul style="list-style: none; margin: 22px 0 0; padding: 0; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 10px; max-width: 640px">
                  {(sv?.chips ?? []).map((c) => (<Fragment>
                    <li><a href={sv?.href} class="chip">{c}</a></li>
                  </Fragment>))}
                </ul>
                <div style="margin-top: 28px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 22px; flex-wrap: wrap">
                  <a href={sv?.href} class="btn btn-w">{sv?.cta} <svg aria-hidden="true" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14M13 5l7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a>
                  <span style="font-size: 15px; color: rgba(255,255,255,.78)">Wycena indywidualna · odpowiedź w 24 h</span>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div data-if="srv-c" data-i={sv.i} hidden={!sv?.closed}>
              <button type="button" class="acc-tab" data-act="srv" data-i={sv.i} aria-label={`Pokaż usługę: ${sv?.title ?? ''}`}>
                <span class="acc-num">{sv?.n}</span>
                <span class="acc-label">{sv?.short}</span>
                <span class="acc-more" aria-hidden="true">Rozwiń<svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"></path></svg></span>
              </button>
            </div>
          </div>
        </Fragment>))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ============ BANER 1 ============ -->
  <section class="cta-sec" aria-labelledby="cta1-h">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="cta rv">
        <div class="cta-txt">
          <span class="cta-k">Bezpłatna konsultacja · 20 min</span>
          <h2 id="cta1-h" class="cta-h">Nie wiesz, od której usługi zacząć?</h2>
          <p class="cta-p">Opowiedz nam o firmie. Wskażemy, co da najszybszy efekt: nowa strona, SEO, kampania czy social media, i ile to realnie potrwa.</p>
          <div class="cta-row">
            <a data-magnetic href="/kontakt/" class="btn btn-w">Umów konsultację</a>
            <a href="tel:+48501784882" class="cta-tel"><svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M22 16.9v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.2 2 19.8 19.8 0 0 1-8.6-3.1 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6A19.8 19.8 0 0 1 2.1 4.2 2 2 0 0 1 4.1 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.7c.1 1 .4 1.9.7 2.8a2 2 0 0 1-.5 2.1L8 9.9a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.3-1.3a2 2 0 0 1 2.1-.4c.9.3 1.8.6 2.8.7a2 2 0 0 1 1.7 2z"></path></svg>501 784 882</a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="cta-img"><img decoding="async" src="/img/konsultantka-telefon.webp" alt="Doradczyni top.strony" width="641" height="1000" loading="lazy"><div class="cta-badge" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><span><b>Odpowiadamy w 24 h</b>pon.–pt. 9:00–20:00</span></div></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ============ 5. EKOSYSTEM ============ -->
  <section id="ekosystem" class="sec deco-wave deco-r" aria-labelledby="eko-h">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="head rv">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow scr">Jak to działa razem</p>
          <h2 id="eko-h" class="h h2 split"><span class="wm"><span class="wi">Jeden</span></span> <span class="wm"><span class="wi">lejek:</span></span> <span class="wm"><span class="wi">od</span></span> <span class="wm"><span class="wi">pierwszego</span></span> <span class="wm"><span class="wi">kontaktu</span></span> <span class="wm"><span class="wi">z</span></span> <span class="wm"><span class="wi">marką</span></span> <span class="wm"><span class="wi">do</span></span> <span class="wm"><span class="wi">telefonu</span></span></h2>
          <p class="lead">Branding daje rozpoznawalność, SEO, reklamy, social media i AI przyprowadzają ruch, a strona zamienia go w zapytania. Mierzymy każdy krok w GA4.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="eco rv d1" data-eco role="img" aria-label="Schemat: sześć źródeł ruchu prowadzi do Twojej strony i marki, a strona zamienia ruch w telefony, formularze i nowych klientów">
        <svg class="eco-svg" aria-hidden="true"></svg>
        <div class="eco-src">
          {(v.sources ?? []).map((s) => (<Fragment>
            <div class="card eco-node"><span class="ic brand"><img decoding="async" src={s?.img} alt="" width="26" height="26"></span><div><b>{s?.t}</b><span>{s?.d}</span></div></div>
          </Fragment>))}
        </div>
        <div class="eco-wires" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <div class="eco-down" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M12 4v16M6 14l6 6 6-6"></path></svg></div>
        <div class="eco-hub pulse"><b>Twoja strona<br>i marka</b><span>branding · UX · szybkość · treści</span></div>
        <div class="eco-down" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M12 4v16M6 14l6 6 6-6"></path></svg></div>
        <div class="eco-wires" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <div class="eco-out">
          {(v.outputs ?? []).map((o) => (<Fragment>
            <div class={`card eco-node ${o?.cls ?? ''}`}><span class="ic"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d={o?.icon}></path></svg></span><div><b>{o?.t}</b><span>{o?.d}</span></div></div>
          </Fragment>))}
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ============ 6. LICZBY ============ -->
  <section id="liczby" class="sec alt deco-bars" aria-labelledby="liczby-h" style="padding-top: 96px; padding-bottom: 96px">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h2 id="liczby-h" class="eyebrow scr" style="margin-bottom: 28px">top.strony w liczbach</h2>
      <div class="nums stg">
        {(v.facts ?? []).map((fa) => (<Fragment>
          <div class="num"><div class="num-v"><span class="cnt">{fa?.v}</span><sup>{fa?.s}</sup></div><div class="num-l">{fa?.l}</div></div>
        </Fragment>))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ============ 7. CASE STUDIES ============ -->
  <section id="realizacje" class="sec deco-rings deco-l" aria-labelledby="real-h">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="head rv">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow scr">Case studies</p>
          <h2 id="real-h" class="h h2 split"><span class="wm"><span class="wi">Projekty,</span></span> <span class="wm"><span class="wi">które</span></span> <span class="wm"><span class="wi">pracują</span></span> <span class="wm"><span class="wi">na</span></span> <span class="wm"><span class="wi">wynik</span></span> <span class="wm"><span class="wi">klienta</span></span></h2>
          <p class="lead">Najważniejsze w skrócie. Pełny opis, wyzwanie i wyniki znajdziesz w każdym case study, a całe portfolio 35 projektów na podstronie realizacji.</p>
        </div>
        <a data-magnetic href="/realizacje/" class="btn btn-d">Wszystkie realizacje</a>
      </div>
      <div class="cases">
        {(v.cases ?? []).map((cs) => (<Fragment>
          <article class="card case rv m-reveal">
            <a href={cs?.href} class="case-img" data-cursor="Zobacz" aria-label={`Case study ${cs?.name ?? ''}`}><span class="m-mask"><span class="m-scrub"><img decoding="async" src={cs?.img} alt={cs?.alt} loading="lazy"></span></span></a>
            <div class="case-body">
              <div class="tags">{(cs?.tags ?? []).map((tg) => (<Fragment><span class="tag">{tg}</span></Fragment>))}</div>
              <h3 class="h">{cs?.name}</h3>
              <p class="case-lead">{cs?.lead}</p>
              <div class="case-res">
                {(cs?.res ?? []).map((r) => (<Fragment><div><b class={r?.cls}>{r?.v}</b><span>{r?.l}</span></div></Fragment>))}
              </div>
              <a href={cs?.href} class="btn btn-o btn-sm case-btn" data-magnetic aria-label={`Zobacz case study: ${cs?.name ?? ''}`}>Zobacz case study <svg aria-hidden="true" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14M13 5l7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a>
            </div>
          </article>
        </Fragment>))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ============ 8. OPINIE GOOGLE ============ -->
  <section id="opinie" class="sec alt deco-wave deco-alt2" aria-labelledby="opinie-h">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="head rv">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow scr">Opinie z Google</p>
          <h2 id="opinie-h" class="h h2 split"><span class="wm"><span class="wi">Klienci</span></span> <span class="wm"><span class="wi">wystawiają</span></span> <span class="wm"><span class="wi">nam</span></span> <span class="wm"><span class="wi">5,0.</span></span> <span class="wm"><span class="wi">Każdy</span></span> <span class="wm"><span class="wi">z</span></span> <span class="wm"><span class="wi">nich.</span></span></h2>
        </div>
        <a href="https://www.google.com/maps?cid=17658555967614608154" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="tlink">Wszystkie opinie w Google →</a>
      </div>
      <div class="rev-wrap">
        <div class="rev-sum rv" data-tilt>
          <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: #C9D2C6"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path fill="#4285F4" d="M22.6 12.2c0-.7-.1-1.4-.2-2H12v3.9h5.9a5 5 0 0 1-2.2 3.3v2.7h3.6c2.1-1.9 3.3-4.8 3.3-7.9z"></path><path fill="#34A853" d="M12 23c3 0 5.5-1 7.3-2.7l-3.6-2.7c-1 .7-2.2 1.1-3.7 1.1-2.9 0-5.3-1.9-6.2-4.5H2.2v2.8A11 11 0 0 0 12 23z"></path><path fill="#FBBC05" d="M5.8 14.2a6.6 6.6 0 0 1 0-4.3V7.1H2.2a11 11 0 0 0 0 9.9z"></path><path fill="#EA4335" d="M12 5.4c1.6 0 3.1.6 4.2 1.7l3.2-3.2A11 11 0 0 0 2.2 7.1l3.6 2.8C6.7 7.3 9.1 5.4 12 5.4z"></path></svg>Profil firmy w Google</div>
          <div class="big">5,0</div>
          <div class="stars" aria-label="5 na 5 gwiazdek">{(v.five ?? []).map((f) => (<Fragment><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 2l3 6.9 7.5.7-5.7 5 1.7 7.4L12 18.3 5.5 22l1.7-7.4-5.7-5 7.5-.7z"></path></svg></Fragment>))}</div>
          <div style="font-size: 15px; color: #C9D2C6">na podstawie 20 opinii</div>
          <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px; margin-top: 6px">
            {(v.dist ?? []).map((d) => (<Fragment>
              <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 14px 1fr 22px; gap: 10px; align-items: center; font-size: 13px; color: #C9D2C6"><span>{d?.s}</span><div style="height: 8px; border-radius: 999px; background: rgba(255,255,255,.1)"><div class="bar" style={d?.style}></div></div><span>{d?.c}</span></div>
            </Fragment>))}
          </div>
          <a href="https://www.google.com/maps?cid=17658555967614608154" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn btn-g" style="margin-top: auto">Wystaw nam opinię</a>
        </div>
        <div class="rev-rows rv d1">
          {(v.reviewRows ?? []).map((row) => (<Fragment>
            <div class={`rev-track ${row?.cls ?? ''}`}>
              {(row?.items ?? []).map((rv) => (<Fragment>
                <figure class="card rev-card">
                  <div class="rev-who"><span class="rev-av" style={`background: ${rv?.color ?? ''}`}>{rv?.ini}</span><div><b>{rv?.name}</b><span>{rv?.meta} · {rv?.when}</span></div></div>
                  <div class="stars" style="margin-top: 10px" aria-label="5 gwiazdek"><svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 2l3 6.9 7.5.7-5.7 5 1.7 7.4L12 18.3 5.5 22l1.7-7.4-5.7-5 7.5-.7z"></path></svg><svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 2l3 6.9 7.5.7-5.7 5 1.7 7.4L12 18.3 5.5 22l1.7-7.4-5.7-5 7.5-.7z"></path></svg><svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 2l3 6.9 7.5.7-5.7 5 1.7 7.4L12 18.3 5.5 22l1.7-7.4-5.7-5 7.5-.7z"></path></svg><svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 2l3 6.9 7.5.7-5.7 5 1.7 7.4L12 18.3 5.5 22l1.7-7.4-5.7-5 7.5-.7z"></path></svg><svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 2l3 6.9 7.5.7-5.7 5 1.7 7.4L12 18.3 5.5 22l1.7-7.4-5.7-5 7.5-.7z"></path></svg></div>
                  <p>{rv?.text}</p>
                  {rv?.hasReply && (<Fragment><div class="rev-reply"><strong class="ink">Odpowiedź właściciela:</strong> {rv?.reply}</div></Fragment>)}
                </figure>
              </Fragment>))}
            </div>
          </Fragment>))}
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ============ BANER 2 ============ -->
  <section class="cta-sec alt" aria-labelledby="cta2-h">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="cta flip rv">
        <div class="cta-img"><img decoding="async" src="/img/konsultantka-zaproszenie.webp" alt="Doradczyni top.strony" width="725" height="1000" loading="lazy"><div class="cta-badge" aria-hidden="true" style="left: auto; right: 0%"><i></i><span><b>Audyt w 48 h</b>SEO · szybkość · AI</span></div></div>
        <div class="cta-txt">
          <span class="cta-k">Bezpłatny audyt</span>
          <h2 id="cta2-h" class="cta-h">Sprawdzimy Twoją stronę za darmo</h2>
          <p class="cta-p">Dostaniesz listę konkretnych poprawek: szybkość, SEO, widoczność w Mapach i w odpowiedziach AI oraz to, co blokuje zapytania od klientów.</p>
          <div class="cta-row">
            <a data-magnetic href="/kontakt/" class="btn btn-w">Zamów bezpłatny audyt</a>
            <a href="tel:+48501784882" class="cta-tel">lub zadzwoń: 501 784 882</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ============ 9. AEO / GEO ============ -->
  <section id="ai" class="sec deco-bars" aria-labelledby="ai-h" style="background: radial-gradient(900px 500px at 15% 30%, var(--glow), transparent 60%), var(--bg)">
    <div class="wrap ai">
      <div class="rv">
        <p class="eyebrow scr">SEO · AEO · GEO</p>
        <h2 id="ai-h" class="h h2 split"><span class="wm"><span class="wi">Widoczność</span></span> <span class="wm"><span class="wi">w</span></span> <span class="wm"><span class="wi">Google</span></span> <span class="wm"><span class="wi">i</span></span> <span class="wm"><span class="wi">w</span></span> <span class="wm"><span class="wi">odpowiedziach</span></span> <span class="wm"><span class="wi">AI</span></span></h2>
        <p class="lead">Klienci coraz częściej pytają ChatGPT, Gemini czy Perplexity: „kto zrobi stronę w Piasecznie?”. Piszemy treści tak, żeby AI mogło je zacytować: odpowiedź w pierwszym zdaniu, konkretne fakty, FAQ, dane strukturalne i plik llms.txt.</p>
        <div class="ai-pts stg">
          {(v.aiPoints ?? []).map((ap) => (<Fragment>
            <div class="card"><b>{ap?.t}</b><span>{ap?.d}</span></div>
          </Fragment>))}
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="rv d2">
        <div class="card chat">
          <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; color: var(--muted); font-size: 13px"><span style="width: 10px; height: 10px; border-radius: 50%; background: #60AD26"></span>Asystent AI · wyszukiwanie w sieci</div>
          <div class="chat-q">Kto zrobi dobrą stronę internetową w Piasecznie?</div>
